# Personal data — sensitive job-search content, not for the public repo.
# Schema lives in database.py (versioned); the actual data does not.
# Both the SQLite DB and the markdown exports it regenerates are user-only.
# (DESIGN §7 originally framed exports/ as committed-to-VC; amended
# 2026-05-04 to privacy-first — see CHANGELOG entry.)
postdoc.db
# Screenshot / demo databases — generated by scripts/seed_demo_db.py and
# pointed at via AAT_DB_PATH; never committed.
demo.db
demo-*.db
exports/

