docs/internal/
docs/superpowers/

# Internal working memory (not public-repo material, gitignored from v1.1).
# The files remain on disk locally — they just aren't tracked.
# See DESIGN.md §4 File Structure and CHANGELOG.md's v1.1 doc refactor entry.
CLAUDE.md
PHASE_*_GUIDELINES.md
*.original.md

